> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Star update\"</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"outlined\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">StarIcon</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">IconButton</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">Tooltip</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> placement</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"bottom\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>Star update&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">Tooltip</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">TooltipTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">RichTooltipTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">IconButton</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Delivery details\"</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">InfoIcon</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style